{"pagination":{"page":1,"size":1000},"total":15,"items":[{"id":"ArraialdoCubo2019","name":"Arraial do Cubo 2019","city":"Fortaleza, Ceará","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2019-06-15","till":"2019-06-15","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","555","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Rafael de Andrade Cinoto","email":"rafael@cinoto.com.br"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Davi de Andrade Iácono","email":"diacono@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"Condomínio Júlio César","address":"Travessa Júlio César, 110","details":"Salão de Festas do Condomínio","coordinates":{"latitude":-3.755978,"longitude":-38.550338}},"information":"Feel free to write us for more help in English.","externalWebsite":"NULL"},{"id":"BelarusNationals2019","name":"Belarus Nationals 2019","city":"Minsk","country":"BY","date":{"from":"2019-06-15","till":"2019-06-16","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333ft","333mbf","333oh","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Ilya Tsiareshka","email":"itsiareshka@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Belarus Speedcubing Federation","email":"scfedbelarus@gmail.com"}],"venue":{"name":"[Palace of Children and Youth](https://mgddm.by/)","address":"ул. Старовиленский тракт 41, Минск, Беларусь","details":"In the Mramorny hall on the first floor","coordinates":{"latitude":53.924878,"longitude":27.543723}},"information":"For more info please visit our [VK Group](https://vk.com/club179128194) Чтобы получить больше информации о чемпионате смотрите нашу группу во Вконтакте - https://vk.com/club179128194. **Final Round Advancements:** For all events with more than one round we will be taking a minimum number of Belarusian competitors to the final. If necessary, we will increase the size of the final by one competitor at a time until we have enough Belarusian competitors. The requirements are 12 Belarusian competitors. **Please Note:** As this is the Belarusian Championship, only competitors who represent the Republic of Belarus will be eligible for prizes. The competition remains open for all nationalities to compete. **Попадание в финальные раунды:** Для тех дисциплин, которые имеют больше одного раунда, мы будем набирать минимальное количество участников, которые имеют белорусское гражданство. При необходимости мы будем расширять количество людей, попадающих в финал, до тех пор, пока не будет набрано минимальное количество участников из Беларуси. В каждый финал попадут минимум 12 белорусских участников. **ВНИМАНИЕ:** Так как это Чемпионат Беларуси, то претендовать на призы могут только граждане Беларуси. В то же время чемпионат остаётся открытым для участия для всех национальностей.","externalWebsite":"https://vk.com/club179128194"},{"id":"BlindNFeetWisconsin2019","name":"Blind N' Feet Wisconsin 2019","city":"Waunakee, Wisconsin","country":"USA","date":{"from":"2019-06-15","till":"2019-06-15","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333ft","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Joshua Feran","email":"jferan@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Joshua Feran","email":"jferan@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"American Legion Post 360","address":"417 E Main St Waunakee, Wisconsin","details":"The competition is being held upstairs.","coordinates":{"latitude":43.19283,"longitude":-89.448886}},"information":"3x3 blindfolded is the main event of this competition. Please see the FMC 2019 tab for more information about the competition.","externalWebsite":"NULL"},{"id":"ConstantaSummerOpen2019","name":"Constanta Summer Open 2019","city":"Contstanta","country":"RO","date":{"from":"2019-06-15","till":"2019-06-16","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","666","777","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Mihai Căpăţinescu","email":"mcapatinescu@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"nam